{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17986","headline":"赠郑兵曹 · 韩愈","name":"赠郑兵曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尊酒相逢十载前，君爲壮夫我少年。\n尊酒相逢十载後，我爲壮夫君白首。\n我材与世不相当，戢鳞委翅无复望。\n当今贤俊皆周行，君何爲乎亦遑遑。\n桮行到君莫停手，破除万事无过酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}